  "plain": "A researcher known online as UAPGerb says that Ronald Moultrie, a senior Pentagon official, set up the offices under which AARO was created, AARO being the Pentagon's office for looking into UFO reports. UAPGerb says Moultrie also sat on the board of the Battelle Memorial Institute, a large private research organisation, and later deleted that role from his LinkedIn page, a professional networking website. He raises it as a sign of quiet links between the people overseeing UFO inquiries and private contractors."
